    "en": "Durga Puja 2027 comes 12 days earlier than this year: Saptami is on Wednesday 6 October 2027 📅\n\nThe rest of next year, for Kolkata:\nSaraswati Puja: Thursday 11 February\nDurga Puja: Shashthi Tuesday 5 October, Saptami Wednesday 6 October\nKali Puja: Thursday 28 October\nBhai Phonta: Sunday 31 October\nJagaddhatri Puja: Sunday 7 November\n\nThe festivals follow the lunar calendar, so check your panjika too. The full calendar is on pujoparikramaguide.in.\n\nSave this, and tell us which date you're marking first 👇",
